WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.650
A few numbers capture the impact.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:07.380
On MSR-VTT,

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.110
VideoComposer scores a Fréchet Video Distance of
five hundred eighty and a CLIP similarity

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:14.840
of zero point two nine three two.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.570
Its motion-control error falls to two point one eight,

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.300
versus four point zero three for a text-only baseline.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.030
And all is learned from two datasets, WebVid-10M
and LAION-400M.
